Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.02,0:22:56.32,ED_CH,,0,0,10,,{\blur1\bord1}音符一分{\fnFOT-ModeMinALarge ProN H\fs75}為{\fnFZCuHeiSong-B-JF\fs60}二  你我一人一半
